{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0181_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_05_title", "source_sha256": "0b65cf459345f9384ffe3c07c5c82a043f4f348730b679906f0a612d4a14e054", "ja": "心をひとつに！", "zh": "团结一心！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0181_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_05_synopsis", "source_sha256": "becb0072c186ec6f7ab95161e8311c37bd9e707ebd31c8b26869f345d2785691", "ja": "オーディション当日。他のユニットに刺激を\n受け、気合いが高まる未来達。強敵達に勝つ\nためには、ユニットとして団結しなければと\n気づく。バラバラだった心が、ひとつの目的\nに向かって重なるのだった。", "zh": "试镜当天。受到其他组合的刺激，未来一行人干劲十足。她们意识到，要战胜强敌，就必须以组合的形式团结起来。原本各自分散的心，开始为了同一个目标而凝聚在一起。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0181_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_05_1000_p", "source_sha256": "30fe5f3506f21a4eb7f0bc77b4c68c69097596f52e72d872ac2a287ee37f52d9", "ja": "（今日は、ネクスト・アイドル・ウェーブの事務所内\nオーディション……そのステージが開かれる日だ）", "zh": "（今天是“Next·偶像·Wave”事务所内部选拔……选拔舞台正式开幕的日子。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0181_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_05_1001_p", "source_sha256": "db251ad7524ec5312b033cefe1565da91ef5712f5e26100ddc81f1785c51ce18", "ja": "（限られた時間の中で皆がどれだけ成長できたか……\n今日はそれを、存分に見せてもらおう！）", "zh": "（今天是Next Idol Wave事务所内部试镜……也就是这个舞台正式开启的日子。）\n（就让我尽情看看，大家在有限的时间里究竟成长了多少吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0181_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_05_1002_016tsu", "source_sha256": "c454728aa1846abee466b9b2f204bdc02ea3161266c835e6f3a70256714b5e1d", "ja": "わぁ～、すごい人！\n事務所内オーディションなのに、お客さん満員ですね？", "zh": "哇～，好多人啊！\n明明只是事务所内部的试镜，观众居然坐得满满当当呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0181_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_05_1003_p", "source_sha256": "6269ed9e6f75ae4b3d84337a7ec47cba35bd3807f91398771a8d63373287fa2b", "ja": "アイドルの評価を決めるのは、観客だからな。\n社長や俺の審査も、もちろんあるけど……。", "zh": "决定偶像评价的，是观众啊。当然，社长和我也会进行评审，不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0181_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_05_1004_p", "source_sha256": "f6d9747b8539bf799b5981fd1df3dfddb982f87c08b302dea752cf02ce018d8d", "ja": "最も観客の注目を集め、声援を受けたユニットが、\nイベントには出場するべきだと思う。", "zh": "我认为，最能吸引观众目光、获得观众声援的组合，\n才应该出场参加活动。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0181_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_05_1005_p", "source_sha256": "f82bb814f896fa74261711e3eef63e2ef4178c3c3aff989136dd724128998ba9", "ja": "お客さんに支持されている、という事かな。", "zh": "也就是说，受到了客人的支持吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0181_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_05_1006_015siz", "source_sha256": "5c7e65fcf377b772d09ab205a207c86424f03bc4187325a204dc21faf6ff379b", "ja": "お客さんの支持……。", "zh": "客人的支持……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0181_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_05_1007_p", "source_sha256": "9e1571bf6631ed2afd164efeef69947728705c942324ff2d0d4637dd51618ad3", "ja": "今回のイベントは、皆にとって大きなチャンスになる。\nだからこそ選抜は公平に行いたいという社長の意向だ。", "zh": "这次的活动对大家来说都是一个很大的机会。\n正因为如此，社长才希望能够公平地进行选拔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0181_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_05_1008_p", "source_sha256": "16978bba075879209f2b9f690f397f5e1c18af67b9f45b67e8a7c909ab97f17f", "ja": "出番までは、自由に見学してていいからな。\nおっ、最初のユニットが始まるな。", "zh": "在轮到你们上场之前，可以自由参观哦。  \n哦，第一组开始了啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0181_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_05_1009_014mir", "source_sha256": "c27cce140759ea1b813f878b59bd2b1f9ec8f7054422f80cdf4d01356c7b4cb9", "ja": "わっ……琴葉ちゃんたち、すっごく気合い入ってる！\n私たちと練習した時より、ずっと上手かも……。", "zh": "哇……琴叶她们干劲十足啊！\n说不定比和我们一起练习时还要厉害……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0181_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_05_1010_015siz", "source_sha256": "6a3cfa7215ab07463abc5963bbb100331bf096a6b301bf5f2dd62470f094a96f", "ja": "私たちががんばったのと同じだけ、他のユニットも\nがんばって、成長してるんですね。だったら……。", "zh": "我们有多努力，其他小组也同样努力，也在成长呢。既然这样……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0181_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_05_1011_016tsu", "source_sha256": "0463445c1744cfce7da879384bbb73da9359f692625b4c5aaf807ce1c944882d", "ja": "だったら……わたしたちが勝つには、\n3人が心をひとつにするしかない！　でしょ？", "zh": "那么……我们要想获胜，就只有让3个人心往一处想了！对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0181_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_05_1012_014mir", "source_sha256": "e72bca5bea14b18312e68d2a0d104c1f8ef1d75a70810dae58f2ad21852993e1", "ja": "翼……。", "zh": "翼……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0181_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_05_1013_016tsu", "source_sha256": "3f48c2491d6aa8d29591973236709e7641552454456db40e3ba2ac3662c8097d", "ja": "あれ？　わたし、何かヘンなこと言った？", "zh": "咦？我刚才说了什么奇怪的话吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0181_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_05_1014_015siz", "source_sha256": "d42be2d92f4bb8bad1a5770f015e4dacdc9efe1c0260e590b226bb87bda92d62", "ja": "う、ううん。……翼がそんなことを言うなんて\n思ってなかったから、ちょっとびっくりしちゃって。", "zh": "不、不是……只是没想到翼会说出那种话，所以有点吃惊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0181_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_05_1015_016tsu", "source_sha256": "096fdcf369aff4ed2628fec573af15c63b65652485c7bbe0e029354cf2c17b5a", "ja": "もー、失礼だよ～。わたしだって、\nこのユニットのこと、いろいろ考えたんだからね？", "zh": "真是的，太失礼了～我也是经过一番考虑的，好好想过这个组合的事呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0181_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_05_1016_016tsu", "source_sha256": "27994bc0fbc258ad48d04bfc6d1a1aa86c01bed81d5feacc50e32ea2143613b8", "ja": "いろいろ考えて……\nそれしか、思いつかなかったんだけど！　えへへ♪", "zh": "我想了很多……\n但最后也只想到了这个！嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0181_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_05_1017_p", "source_sha256": "47f02ff1b31cd480c9c59b3dca82e3de0574a4c0031ed6e20dd55c6f730d8bbe", "ja": "そんな事ないぞ、翼。心をひとつにするって事は、\nつまり、全員が同じ方向を目指すって事だからな。", "zh": "不是那样，翼。所谓心往一处想，也就是说，所有人都朝着同一个方向努力。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0181_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_05_1018_p", "source_sha256": "16b73d26a5da990b616952f50112b6d87e17e4e6a5f3a613c31558590db61bd6", "ja": "どんなに一人ひとりの能力が高くても、目指すものが\nバラバラじゃ、ユニットとしては上手くいかないんだ。", "zh": "不管每个人的能力有多强，如果目标各不相同，作为一个组合也是无法顺利运作的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0181_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_05_1019_014mir", "source_sha256": "2b14266bb2650d92363f2fd7700fe92c1e54226f1005f31f91d411f6f4c116fa", "ja": "全員で、同じ方向を目指す……わからないかもだけど、\nわかりました！　私、今からやってみますっ！", "zh": "全员朝着同一个方向努力……可能你不明白吧，\n我明白了！我现在就试试看！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0181_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_05_1020_015siz", "source_sha256": "bbad1339dfece3bab6db12552375fb869ae70f3e8542926379243e5c1e57c14c", "ja": "み、未来？　今からって、一体何を……。", "zh": "未、未来？说什么现在开始，你到底要……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0181_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_05_1021_014mir", "source_sha256": "14db71643e5f9f0d1db10110c5566c4b307d1be608b58c6a61dac5ff4338a0d4", "ja": "あのね、静香ちゃん！\n私、静香ちゃんと翼と、このユニットで勝ちたい！", "zh": "那个啊，静香！\n我想要和静香还有翼，靠这个组合赢下去！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0181_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_05_1022_015siz", "source_sha256": "405a06bcaf840219e527f58d0620776303d9dcde719f63fa69971776baf32e17", "ja": "！　未来……。", "zh": "！未来……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0181_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_05_1023_016tsu", "source_sha256": "296143652ae3fb79caca073e116797e4a561f77d180a351d653d275177c8bf3b", "ja": "あはっ。", "zh": "啊哈。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0181_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_05_1024_014mir", "source_sha256": "3ef10f0aa531dd07107320323e00df7373baba2496dbc228875111cdc87b57c5", "ja": "私、ふたりとユニットできてすっごく嬉しかった！\nあと、静香ちゃんと翼に、置いていかれたくない！", "zh": "我跟你们两个组成了队伍，真的超开心！\n还有，我不想被静香和翼甩在后面！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0181_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_05_1025_014mir", "source_sha256": "089d4975d8950ed6993062f0c727e5af94c5b53f0c3eeb0e89dc8025d6fe31cf", "ja": "置いていく覚悟とか苦しみとかまだよくわからないし、\n他にも、考えてないこといっぱいあると思うけど……", "zh": "我还不太明白被留下的觉悟和痛苦，也觉得自己还有很多事情没有考虑到……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0181_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_05_1026_014mir", "source_sha256": "6c042ada229fc89076953b042de9bb3bdbce277f28bf7c8a2178da27145817f9", "ja": "でも、すっごく、一生懸命やるから！　私といっしょに\nこのオーディションに勝って、グランプリ目指そうっ！", "zh": "不过，我会拼尽全力的！和我一起赢下这场选拔，向大奖赛冠军进发吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0181_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_05_1027_016tsu", "source_sha256": "ebe12ab9593c2dcdcaffe94fb5db172ea952ff259be3e2ec52b771dc3b56b1d1", "ja": "もちろん！　だってわたしは最初からそのつもりだし。\nね、静香ちゃん？", "zh": "当然！因为我从一开始就是这么打算的。\n对吧，静香？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0181_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_05_1028_015siz", "source_sha256": "976e665d22e084e0fe876da32be2145d221043b45d7f30750d710cb1cc53379d", "ja": "そうね。……未来、翼。私も、あなたたちを信じる。\n私たちなら、きっとできる……！", "zh": "是啊……未来、翼。我也相信你们。\n我们一定能做到……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0181_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_05_1029_p", "source_sha256": "9dd6d8c2092b65bb14cd42a382fe80444ef06851677aa84adbb08256cef51dc7", "ja": "（未来……静香も翼も、問題なさそうだな。\nあとは、実力を出し切るだけ……）", "zh": "（未来……静香和翼看起来都没问题。\n接下来只要发挥出全部实力就行了……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0181_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_05_1030_p", "source_sha256": "c3b4f605173345765cd16fa5c1380fa479b889f4dce4b929ce434bf978502109", "ja": "未来、翼、静香。\n3人とも、悔いのないようにな！", "zh": "未来、翼、静香。你们3人都要做到不留遗憾啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0181_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_05_1031_014mir", "source_sha256": "c8437da922b05a66a006272ae646cc70f57e96453c9e5b620e3abbd8e90368f7", "ja": "はい！", "zh": "好的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
