{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0181_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_05_1034_audience", "source_sha256": "c81d7a0a4fbd2016f83300f2d355cfba0e501e5e533a81678ae25b62fafb852e", "ja": "ワァアアアア！！！！", "zh": "哇啊啊啊啊！！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0181_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_05_1035_016tsu", "source_sha256": "0a1f72e3dc6c68f775c0eacb672ef92e2fc0d80182c36fa23f252cbd0d1b7953", "ja": "あれ？　……ねえねえ未来、静香ちゃん！\nあそこにいるのって……。", "zh": "咦？……等等未来、静香！\n在那里的那个人……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0181_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_05_1036_015siz", "source_sha256": "d2bb491b4a6e6ee149e6af2ce8830529a47d1f71f6349566eb58c97e6209f99b", "ja": "ええっ！？　あ、あれって、もしかして……！", "zh": "诶！？那、那个难道是……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0181_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_05_1037_014mir", "source_sha256": "e7854c49dd1be1004aa2174d73575a3d4791f44dae48842a4461110ba27c5d00", "ja": "あーっ！　玲音さんに、詩花さんだ～！\nふたりとも、観に来てくれたのかな？", "zh": "啊——！是玲音，还有诗花～！\n她们两位是特地来看演出的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0181_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_05_1038_015siz", "source_sha256": "ab734659593b42309781001297fe820c09901e2719b2e99a4929e1e1182d4b13", "ja": "……決まってるじゃない。ふたりとも、私たちの\n劇場を、ライバルだと思ってるってことよ。", "zh": "……这还用说吗。意思就是她们两个，\n把我们的剧场当成了竞争对手呀。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0181_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_05_1039_016tsu", "source_sha256": "a24826509d8204fb5ba3bf555a6cb3e420601a4645fb73ed60aefd6c10a6cab4", "ja": "えーっ！\nそれってつまり、テキジョーシサツってこと！？", "zh": "诶——！\n也就是说，她们是来刺探敌情的！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0181_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_05_1040_015siz", "source_sha256": "0cf94d9c536085dbd8da25728a3f20636739050190f5526e44e1d98887c1f1d3", "ja": "玲音さんと詩花さんが観てる以上、みっともない姿\nなんて見せられない……！　行くわよ、未来、翼！", "zh": "既然玲音和诗花都在看……就不能让她们看到我丢人的样子！上吧，未来、翼！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0181_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_05_1041_014mir", "source_sha256": "9c1ec5e6eb430f0be966a9886391f3e0dfeb44f0e8a64ac1af17cc806edc419c", "ja": "うんっ！", "zh": "嗯！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
